<title>GERMANY: German July wholesale prices down 1.0 pct mth/mth.</title>
<headline>German July wholesale prices down 1.0 pct mth/mth.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office said on Wednesday that German wholesale prices fell 1.0 percent month-on-month in July.</p>
<p>Year-on-year, wholesale prices rose 2.0 percent in July, the office said.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
